            "end": 76
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:central#e-f29f6c6412bcab44",
          "text": "The hostels in Rome offer a bed in a dorm room for around $25 a night, and for that, you’ll often get to stay in a central location（位置）with security and comfort.",
