            "end": 32
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:central#e-1dc1183836612078",
          "text": "It is not my intention to point out the central theme of each of the plays in this collection, for that would, indeed, ruin the pleasure of reading, discussing, and thinking about the plays and the effectiveness of the playwright.",
